53
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:41,880
I'm hoping to have more and more customers at the release event.

54
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:47,600
October 14th, and after the new year, January 21st.

55
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,000
As for this...

56
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,200
We're really putting our best foot forward.

57
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:51,200
I'm putting my money on it.

58
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:52,300
You are.

59
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:54,100
