Do you know it? There's a tea farm in Saitama Prefecture.

72
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,000
Yes, sir.

73
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,000
I see.

74
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,000
