75
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
I understand. The Sayama tea was delicious.

76
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,900
Was it good? Thank you.

77
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:29,600
Now, then, to the customers.

78
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,600
You know, we have to sell these out now.

79
